   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Karl and others,<div><br></div><div>Karl, thank you for your earlier reply. <br><div><br></div><div>I think that I figured out my issues. After forming a linkage group I was using &quot;est.rf&quot; to make my genetic map and I needed to use &quot;est.map&quot; to  estimate the genetic positions of the markers. Currently everything is working well.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Sean</div></div></div>"
    ],
